Description: AI code editor that works offline
 ZeroEgress has chat, an agent mode, quick edit and autocomplete, and talks
 only to model servers you run yourself (Ollama, vLLM or LM Studio, on your
 machine or your own network). It connects to loopback and to the servers you
 configure, and nothing else. Telemetry, auto-update, the online extension
 marketplace and cloud sign-in are removed.
